  "name": "Bloodmage: Nightmare spends 2% health on Rage abilities above 50% health for 10% more damage (#12959)",
  "contract": [
    "#12959: Nightmare 300226 reads 'While above 50% maximum health, abilities that cost Rage now consume",
    "$704257s2% of your maximum health to damage or heal your target for an additional $301273s1% of the value.'",
    "The PR author's ruling (2026-11-20): above 50% health a Rage-costing spell spends 2% of maximum health,",
    "taken like the other Bloodmage health costs (ModifyHealth, unmitigated), and its own damage or healing is",
    "10% higher; at or below 50% nothing changes. $704257s2 is Self Damage 704257 effect 1 (BasePoints 1 +",
    "DieSides 1 = 2) and $301273s1 is 301273 effect 0 (9 + 1 = 10). Before the fix the rider 301273 had no proc",
    "flags and no spell_proc row, so nothing happened. Bloodfang Bite rank 1 (501695, 30 Rage, needs Eternal",
    "Curse 800157 like bloodmage-bite-wound-native-4251) is the probe: its effect 0 rolls 90-92 plus a fixed AP",
    "term, so one cast varies by under 2%. Forced critical strikes keep every cast on the same multiplier.",
    "Maximum health is pinned to 10000 so 2% is exactly 200. DISCRIMINATING: at 9000 health a cast costs 200",
    "health and deals 1.07-1.13x the 4000-health cast; at 4000 and at exactly 5000 health no health is spent and",
    "the 5000-health cast deals 0.97-1.03x."
  ],
